l areas. Within the thematic cycle analysis further milestones were to be identified from the media coverage and phases of changing reporting were to be formed. The central question of the second work package was Is national reporting on rural areas still focussing on the internationally known topics or are there thematic shifts in media reporting In the third work package the various work packages of the two sub projects were brought together with the help of a transfer conference and an exchange with representatives from politics business and culture.	15	2.067591
