nternet makes it possible to get new knowledge filter Ü65 people of my age should learn how to use digital media filter Ü35 U65 older people like my parents should learn how to use digital media filter U35 older people like my grandparents should learn how to use digital media again all of them due to the internet I can keep in touch with many people better internet connection and the devices are too expensive for me personally I just don t understand many things on the internet.Demography sex age grouped employment status and type of employment branch highest level of education. Additionally coded was respondent ID weighting factor.	3	3.6431882
