5275	democracy	ZA7557	CSES Module 5 Full Release	CSES Module 5 2016 2021 focuses on the politics of populism. It explores the relationship between the rise of populist parties and the distribution of populist attitudes cross nationally. The main objective of the module is to examine citizens perceptions of political elites out groups and national identity and the implications for electoral democracy. The module enables researchers to account for variation in the contestation of political elites and populist attitudes across democracies and to examine how such perceptions shape citizens electoral behavior.	3	1.7683345
