ges or disadvantages of a free trade agreement for the German economy and consumers in Germany expectation of greater benefits by TTIP for the EU or the US.Demography age sex education employment status occupational status marital status confession household income grouped party preference sunday question .Additionally coded was respondent ID federal state size of community weighting factor.	11	3.1504123
